        "narrationHAlignment": "left",
        "narrationPosX": 150,
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:遭受了Magius之翼推进的计划的飞来横祸，]@[textBlack:PROMISED BLOOD对身边的魔法少女心怀怨恨。]",
        "turnChangeOut": "fadeOut",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102901/vo_full_102901-1-1"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:神滨魔法联盟则被]@[textBlack:PROMISED BLOOD夺走了同伴的性命。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102901/vo_full_102901-1-2"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:不断重复着无数冲突的两个团体]@[textBlack:在通过二木市的战斗放下武器之后，]@[textBlack:终于开始准备与彼此联手。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102901/vo_full_102901-1-3"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:虽然这一过于突然的决断]@[textBlack:在两个团体内都引起了混乱，]@[textBlack:但也带来了像假象一般安稳而风平浪静的时间。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102901/vo_full_102901-1-4"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:这时的伊吕波小姐和红晴小姐她们]@[textBlack:正在一边修复团体中产生的歪曲]@[textBlack:一边做好了终结]@[textBlack:这场围绕着][textYellow:心魔][textBlack:石的战斗的准备。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102901/vo_full_102901-1-5"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:很遗憾，躺在病床上的我]@[textBlack:没能亲眼看见大家积极地拉起手来的样子。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102901/vo_full_102901-1-6"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:但是，我能像这样将事情编纂成文传达出来]@[textBlack:都是多亏了莉薇娅小姐她们]@[textBlack:Puella Care的三人代替我进行取材。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102901/vo_full_102901-1-7"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:除此之外，其他魔法少女]@[textBlack:也会在探病的时候顺便告诉我状况，]@[textBlack:帮了很大的忙。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102901/vo_full_102901-1-8"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:所以，我想借此机会对大家表达感谢]@[textBlack:并回顾一下当时的情形。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102901/vo_full_102901-1-9"
      },
